WEBVTT

00:00:03.170 --> 00:00:05.970
<i>My name is Banryuu Reoko.</i>

00:00:06.450 --> 00:00:08.820
<i>I was born a qualified heart user,</i>

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:11.690
<i>having inherited Entei's 
heart from my mother.</i>

00:00:12.210 --> 00:00:14.410
<i>In the spring of my sixteenth year,</i>

00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:17.630
<i>I was told I only had 
three years left to live.</i>

00:00:18.040 --> 00:00:22.790
<i>So I wanted to leave behind 
proof that I had lived.</i>

00:00:28.550 --> 00:00:30.500
Oh, by the way, Reoko...

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:35.260
I have a boyfriend now.
I'll introduce you sometime.

00:00:35.260 --> 00:00:37.030
Eh? Huh?

00:00:37.320 --> 00:00:38.830
What?!

00:00:41.800 --> 00:00:44.360
Y-You have a boyfriend, Migiwa?

00:00:44.360 --> 00:00:45.010
Yeah.

00:00:45.530 --> 00:00:49.360
I can't believe you, of all people,
got one before me!

00:00:49.360 --> 00:00:51.510
Before me, Reoko-sama!

00:00:51.860 --> 00:00:54.240
Here! I finally found it!

00:00:54.240 --> 00:01:00.700
A text hinting at Entei's deep, ancient
connection with the concept of immortality!

00:01:00.700 --> 00:01:03.120
Reoko, look at this!

00:01:04.830 --> 00:01:05.750
Sure.

00:01:09.090 --> 00:01:10.350
Migiwa...

00:01:11.280 --> 00:01:14.670
You once incinerated my hands and feet.

00:01:15.130 --> 00:01:17.920
Now it's your turn to be burned alive!

00:01:23.620 --> 00:01:26.090
<b>Kazuki Manor 
(Now Banryuu Manor)</b>

00:01:28.170 --> 00:01:29.360
Migiwa-sama!

00:01:29.360 --> 00:01:32.650
Banryuu Reoko and her followers 
have started a revolt in Ueno.

00:01:30.840 --> 00:01:33.770
<b>Kazuki Migiwa   Age 16</b>

00:01:32.650 --> 00:01:34.280
They've called forth Entei!

00:01:35.400 --> 00:01:37.680
They called a Buranki in front of civilians?

00:01:37.680 --> 00:01:39.530
Has Banryuu gone mad?

00:01:41.140 --> 00:01:44.450
Genma-san, Yoshiki-san... I'll go in Oubu.

00:01:46.070 --> 00:01:46.910
Right on!

00:01:47.820 --> 00:01:51.590
Sever your contracts with your 
Bubuki and give them to me.

00:01:53.020 --> 00:01:56.690
Lady, no matter what the circumstances,
you ask too much!

00:01:58.430 --> 00:02:01.580
I will stop Reoko myself.

00:02:04.490 --> 00:02:06.470
I'll say it one more time, everyone.

00:02:04.910 --> 00:02:08.260
<b>Banryuu Reoko   Age 16</b>

00:02:06.950 --> 00:02:10.440
There's no need for you 
to stay with me anymore.

00:02:11.220 --> 00:02:13.680
What are you talking about? That's cold.

00:02:13.680 --> 00:02:16.940
As unlikely allies, we'll all share one fate.

00:02:18.190 --> 00:02:19.740
That's right, Reoko.

00:02:23.490 --> 00:02:26.130
We will bring Buranki out 
into the light of day

00:02:26.130 --> 00:02:29.750
and make known the history that 
the adults have kept hidden.

00:02:30.020 --> 00:02:31.950
We will change the world!

00:02:31.950 --> 00:02:32.970
Yeah!

00:02:40.590 --> 00:02:41.970
Migiwa...

00:03:07.660 --> 00:03:09.270
What in the world happened?!

00:03:09.270 --> 00:03:10.660
What's wrong, Reoko?!

00:03:11.360 --> 00:03:14.420
I can feel Entei's pain...

00:03:31.540 --> 00:03:32.740
Reoko-sama!

00:03:32.740 --> 00:03:35.550
What the hell is that power?

00:03:35.550 --> 00:03:38.760
I thought she made Momoka-neesan
and the others sever their contracts

00:03:38.760 --> 00:03:41.140
so she could control Oubu by herself!

00:03:45.440 --> 00:03:49.220
This was the only way to save you...

00:03:49.220 --> 00:03:51.460
I'm sorry, Reoko.

00:03:56.140 --> 00:04:00.460
If I crush Entei's heart, 
Reoko's body should...

00:04:02.090 --> 00:04:04.970
Reoko, you and I are as one.

00:04:05.690 --> 00:04:07.930
I won't let you die!

00:04:31.300 --> 00:04:32.310
Entei...

00:04:33.520 --> 00:04:35.350
Take care of Reoko.

00:04:38.520 --> 00:04:41.870
<b>Eight Years Later</b>

00:04:44.970 --> 00:04:47.930
<b>Banryuu Reoko   Age 24</b>

00:04:48.320 --> 00:04:52.170
<b>Banryuu Reoko's body
 stopped maturing eight years ago</b>

00:04:50.840 --> 00:04:52.470
You look well.

00:04:52.840 --> 00:04:57.280
Migiwa, you knew about Entei's 
special ability, didn't you?

00:04:57.860 --> 00:05:01.390
That's why you crushed Entei's heart,

00:05:01.390 --> 00:05:04.600
which made me its replacement.

00:05:04.600 --> 00:05:09.120
It was Entei's power that kept me alive.

00:05:11.840 --> 00:05:15.040
But is this really me?

00:05:15.810 --> 00:05:21.000
Every day, I see this monster that 
never ages looking back at me.

00:05:21.730 --> 00:05:24.170
I'm going up to the Buranki nest.

00:05:24.170 --> 00:05:24.890
Huh?

00:05:26.330 --> 00:05:31.810
I've decided to go up there 
while Oubu still listens to me.

00:05:33.170 --> 00:05:35.600
I'll leave things here on Earth to you.

00:05:37.600 --> 00:05:41.160
After you kept me locked 
in here for eight years?!

00:05:41.590 --> 00:05:44.190
I did it to protect you from the world.

00:05:44.730 --> 00:05:46.150
Please understand.

00:05:49.830 --> 00:05:51.240
Migiwa!

00:05:51.240 --> 00:05:55.160
I'll never forgive you!

00:05:55.160 --> 00:05:56.750
Don't you run away, Migiwa.

00:05:57.280 --> 00:05:58.270
Migiwa...

00:06:03.800 --> 00:06:05.260
<b>Kazuki</b>

00:06:06.570 --> 00:06:08.130
Reoko-sama?

00:06:08.690 --> 00:06:10.390
You are Reoko-sama, right?

00:06:12.010 --> 00:06:16.390
Please, guys... Don't laugh 
at the way I look...

00:06:16.390 --> 00:06:19.310
Thank goodness you're well!

00:06:19.900 --> 00:06:21.910
I'm so glad!

00:06:21.910 --> 00:06:26.890
I was so worried you were 
being tortured or something!

00:06:26.890 --> 00:06:29.110
Little Sou will be thrilled, too!

00:06:29.540 --> 00:06:34.500
Shuusaku was so worried about you,
his hair turned white.

00:06:34.500 --> 00:06:36.700
Shut up! That's none of your business!

00:06:37.140 --> 00:06:41.330
Reoko, you look that way because 
of Entei's power, right?

00:06:42.840 --> 00:06:43.860
Yeah.

00:06:43.860 --> 00:06:46.030
You get to stay young forever!

00:06:46.030 --> 00:06:48.760
I'm so freaking jealous of you!

00:06:48.760 --> 00:06:53.780
One of these days, I'll get 
eternal youth for myself, too!

00:07:01.220 --> 00:07:02.730
Thanks,

00:07:03.230 --> 00:07:04.300
you guys.

00:07:07.880 --> 00:07:11.240
<i>The light that raced across 
all the world's skies</i>

00:07:11.240 --> 00:07:14.830
<i>stopped the hearts of all Buranki on Earth.</i>

00:07:15.520 --> 00:07:19.660
<i>Without Buranki, the world 
fell into chaos and ruin.</i>

00:07:20.800 --> 00:07:24.670
<i>And I, as a human being, changed.</i>

00:07:27.610 --> 00:07:30.120
The mechanized regiments and tank regiments

00:07:28.230 --> 00:07:32.670
<b>Banryuu Reoko   Age 30</b>

00:07:30.120 --> 00:07:34.150
have begun deployment via the 
western and southern sea routes.

00:07:35.200 --> 00:07:36.310
Reoko-sama?

00:07:41.280 --> 00:07:44.060
Hunting down and killing Bubuki users...

00:07:44.630 --> 00:07:48.070
How can they do this to other humans?

00:07:48.850 --> 00:07:53.120
There's no need to kill even children, 
just because they can use Bubuki!

00:07:53.120 --> 00:07:55.130
It's probably because they're children.

00:07:55.550 --> 00:07:58.080
They kill them before they can 
properly use their Rinzu.

00:07:59.210 --> 00:08:03.380
I'll never accept such a mad world.

00:08:04.480 --> 00:08:08.620
Zetsubi-san, please return to Banryuu 
Manor and tell Reoko-sama about this.

00:08:09.310 --> 00:08:10.840
There's something I must do.

00:08:20.990 --> 00:08:24.820
The forces have divided communications 
between local settlements and the outside.

00:08:24.820 --> 00:08:28.610
They seem to be isolating and surrounding 
them, then annihilating them.

00:08:28.610 --> 00:08:30.010
Damn it.

00:08:30.010 --> 00:08:33.960
And Genma's just going to stay 
silent while all this is going on?

00:08:33.960 --> 00:08:36.110
Where the hell is he, anyway?

00:08:36.110 --> 00:08:40.630
Asabuki Genma remains missing, 
along with the Raijoudou

00:08:40.630 --> 00:08:42.620
he stole from the fallen Oubu.

00:08:43.680 --> 00:08:46.500
That spineless trash...

00:08:50.800 --> 00:08:55.110
<i>Migiwa, surely you knew this 
would happen once you stopped</i>

00:08:55.110 --> 00:08:57.370
<i>the hearts of all Buranki on Earth.</i>

00:08:58.250 --> 00:09:02.580
<i>Deprived of Buranki, humans have 
been impelled by their fear</i>

00:09:02.580 --> 00:09:04.840
<i>to kill their own kind again.</i>

00:09:05.530 --> 00:09:08.820
<i>The world is full of small-minded fools.</i>

00:09:12.120 --> 00:09:13.980
Prepare the coffins.

00:09:16.200 --> 00:09:19.050
Be wary of enemies, but move quickly.

00:09:19.430 --> 00:09:21.040
Watch our rear, as well.

00:09:23.180 --> 00:09:24.310
Battle formation!

00:09:47.560 --> 00:09:48.780
Akihito...

00:09:49.500 --> 00:09:53.120
Reoko-sama, I... I...

00:09:53.120 --> 00:09:56.820
You truly look like a 
man-eating beast right now.

00:10:00.560 --> 00:10:03.780
Perfect for joining in 
our funeral procession.

00:10:10.560 --> 00:10:14.950
Many pardons. I didn't 
expect so much snow—

00:10:16.940 --> 00:10:19.470
Wh-What is this?!

00:10:20.200 --> 00:10:23.210
Japan's 107th Prime Minister...

00:10:24.100 --> 00:10:28.340
You gave the order to hunt down 
and kill Bubuki users, correct?

00:10:28.340 --> 00:10:30.060
Banryuu Reoko!

00:10:30.060 --> 00:10:31.980
I-It was a Cabinet decision!

00:10:32.880 --> 00:10:35.820
That makes it all the more 
your responsibility,

00:10:35.820 --> 00:10:38.320
as the leader of this country!

00:10:40.640 --> 00:10:42.530
Are you going to kill me?

00:10:42.530 --> 00:10:47.740
A man like you, who would even kill 
babies to ensure his own survival,

00:10:47.740 --> 00:10:49.870
does not deserve to live!

00:10:50.460 --> 00:10:53.750
Sir, an urgent message has 
been received at your home...

00:10:55.000 --> 00:10:55.830
Sir?

00:11:04.680 --> 00:11:08.180
<b>Secretary
Ichitou Kotetsu</b>

00:11:05.070 --> 00:11:08.180
Ichitou Kotetsu, is it?

00:11:08.520 --> 00:11:09.570
Y-Yes...

00:11:09.570 --> 00:11:12.600
I'll make you the head of this country.

00:11:13.230 --> 00:11:18.110
You're going to spend the rest 
of your life as my puppet.

00:11:29.440 --> 00:11:34.630
That bastard Guy threw the Demokratia forces 
into this right at the critical moment.

00:11:34.920 --> 00:11:37.680
The island's barrier won't 
hold out at this rate.

00:11:37.680 --> 00:11:39.070
Worse than that.

00:11:39.070 --> 00:11:42.420
Its orbit will drop,
and it'll crash to Earth.

00:11:42.420 --> 00:11:47.000
So the map of the world will 
literally be redrawn.

00:11:47.000 --> 00:11:50.770
Countless people are going to die.

00:12:00.490 --> 00:12:04.940
<b>Episode 12
The Boy from Treasure Island</b>

00:12:06.690 --> 00:12:10.100
You monster, who conceived a child 
and handed down your Bubuki,

00:12:10.100 --> 00:12:12.670
but still didn't lose your power...

00:12:15.220 --> 00:12:17.760
Die along with the Buranki that

00:12:17.760 --> 00:12:21.300
forsook humans to try to 
protect this island, Migiwa!

00:12:23.790 --> 00:12:26.050
Let my mom go, Reoko!

00:12:26.380 --> 00:12:27.810
Oubu...

00:12:27.810 --> 00:12:30.770
Stay out of my way!

00:12:37.440 --> 00:12:42.600
I can't stand those eyes of yours,
which look down on everyone else!

00:12:44.110 --> 00:12:44.950
Mom!

00:12:59.400 --> 00:13:00.580
<b>Giant</b>

00:13:05.470 --> 00:13:06.820
Tactical nuclear warfare?!

00:13:06.820 --> 00:13:09.460
Assuming their aim is to destroy
and bring down the Buranki nest,

00:13:09.460 --> 00:13:11.140
that would be the logical conclusion.

00:13:11.650 --> 00:13:15.140
Neither our Bubuki nor or 
bodies can withstand this.

00:13:15.410 --> 00:13:19.110
That doesn't mean we can just watch!

00:13:23.860 --> 00:13:27.080
Migiwa, you are the one 
person I'll never forgive!

00:13:29.610 --> 00:13:31.510
You monster!

00:13:41.830 --> 00:13:45.470
Entei, please continue 
to take care of Reoko.

00:13:53.080 --> 00:13:53.970
Migiwa?!

00:14:07.530 --> 00:14:08.570
Mom!

00:14:33.850 --> 00:14:35.010
Hey, Azuma!

00:14:35.010 --> 00:14:36.070
What are you doing?!

00:14:36.070 --> 00:14:38.560
A-chan, what's wrong? We have to hurry!

00:14:40.030 --> 00:14:42.150
I'll do something about Treasure Island.

00:14:42.150 --> 00:14:42.960
Huh?

00:14:42.960 --> 00:14:44.440
B-But...

00:14:44.440 --> 00:14:46.410
I heard Mom's voice.

00:14:47.300 --> 00:14:49.710
I know she's all right.

00:14:50.560 --> 00:14:51.640
Azuma...

00:14:51.640 --> 00:14:52.890
A-chan...

00:14:59.020 --> 00:15:03.260
Even that monster could never 
survive a fall from this height.

00:15:03.260 --> 00:15:07.380
I'll send you to your mother's 
side, as well, witch's son!

00:15:08.900 --> 00:15:11.050
Weren't you going to protect your country?

00:15:11.420 --> 00:15:12.300
What?

00:15:13.180 --> 00:15:14.930
If this island falls,

00:15:14.930 --> 00:15:19.270
won't everything you were trying 
to protect disappear for good,

00:15:20.360 --> 00:15:22.020
Reoko?!

00:15:27.940 --> 00:15:29.940
Damn you!

00:15:34.560 --> 00:15:38.560
Is Oubu gonna fall apart 
if we can't hang in there?

00:15:38.560 --> 00:15:41.330
All right, Himekiri, Hoemaru!

00:15:41.720 --> 00:15:42.420
Tsurarai!

00:15:42.420 --> 00:15:43.500
Iwatooshi!

00:15:43.500 --> 00:15:45.420
Let's do it, Righty-chan!

00:15:46.500 --> 00:15:48.210
Thanks, guys.

00:15:52.930 --> 00:15:54.620
Migiwa...

00:15:54.620 --> 00:15:59.350
That woman abandoned our world 
and fled to the Buranki nest!

00:15:59.350 --> 00:16:01.890
After putting a curse on me!

00:16:01.890 --> 00:16:06.110
No matter how many times I'm reborn, 
I'll never forget what she did to me!

00:16:06.110 --> 00:16:07.520
You're wrong!

00:16:07.520 --> 00:16:12.080
My mom came to Treasure Island to ensure 
no more Buranki would fall to Earth!

00:16:12.080 --> 00:16:13.820
To protect the world!

00:16:14.030 --> 00:16:15.970
Well, that's a simple matter!

00:16:15.970 --> 00:16:19.330
All one has to do is kill all the Buranki!

00:16:20.200 --> 00:16:23.040
That's not right... You're wrong!

00:16:23.370 --> 00:16:28.420
My mom was trying to protect 
both Buranki and human life!

00:16:28.740 --> 00:16:31.630
Life?! Did you say "life," boy?!

00:16:32.070 --> 00:16:35.150
Don't use the word "life" so lightly!

00:16:35.150 --> 00:16:37.790
When humans and Buranki kill one another,

00:16:37.790 --> 00:16:40.020
only one or the other can survive!

00:16:40.020 --> 00:16:45.550
My cursed body that never ages and 
perpetually comes back from the dead

00:16:45.550 --> 00:16:48.150
exists for the purpose of 
killing every last Buranki!

00:16:49.520 --> 00:16:52.540
No life can exist for the 
sake of ending life.

00:16:53.050 --> 00:16:56.160
Life exists to protect life!

00:16:58.040 --> 00:17:01.160
After I've hunted down 
and killed all Buranki,

00:17:01.160 --> 00:17:05.670
I'll destroy Entei and end my own life.

00:17:10.090 --> 00:17:11.510
You can't do that.

00:17:12.900 --> 00:17:15.550
That would be way too sad.

00:17:17.320 --> 00:17:20.680
Boy, that's the one thing I 
never want you saying about me!

00:17:29.620 --> 00:17:34.450
Now, just as we planned,
the Buranki nest will fall to Earth.

00:17:34.890 --> 00:17:41.830
It's a fitting end for such ugly, 
filthy beings as the Buranki.

00:17:45.670 --> 00:17:47.370
You should watch this closely,

00:17:48.230 --> 00:17:49.480
Kaoruko.

00:17:51.870 --> 00:17:55.950
Damn... Never mind saving 
Reoko-sama, at this rate I'll—

00:17:59.070 --> 00:18:00.760
Y-You're...

00:18:01.140 --> 00:18:02.480
Ryuuki?!

00:18:02.480 --> 00:18:06.430
What is the user of the Buranki 
Patrov's heart doing here?!

00:18:07.360 --> 00:18:08.770
I've achieved my goal.

00:18:09.090 --> 00:18:10.540
I get it...

00:18:10.540 --> 00:18:14.440
You're here to take me out 
at Guy's orders, right?!

00:18:33.240 --> 00:18:35.380
Yeah, of course not...

00:18:47.850 --> 00:18:49.980
Lyudmila! Gianna!

00:18:50.430 --> 00:18:53.360
Good grief. So that's it.

00:18:53.820 --> 00:18:54.970
Sensei!

00:18:56.100 --> 00:18:57.150
No!

00:19:04.680 --> 00:19:05.430
<b>Nothing</b>

00:19:11.730 --> 00:19:15.500
I swear... Akihito-kun, 
you're always overdoing it.

00:19:15.500 --> 00:19:18.010
Your Bubuki won't last long 
if you keep doing that.

00:19:18.360 --> 00:19:21.510
Well, I guess I'm in no position to talk...

00:19:26.790 --> 00:19:29.550
It's actually overwhelming Reoko's Entei...

00:19:31.590 --> 00:19:37.190
Azuma, Kogane, Kinoa, Shizuru, Hiiragi...

00:19:37.650 --> 00:19:41.280
You kids really managed to 
come straight to this point.

00:19:41.600 --> 00:19:44.070
It's brilliant... Dazzlingly brilliant.

00:19:44.950 --> 00:19:50.420
I'm going to use all the strength 
I have to live this moment, too.

00:20:02.590 --> 00:20:04.850
The limbs won't hold out!

00:20:14.720 --> 00:20:19.710
I don't know where the 
Buranki came from, or when,

00:20:19.710 --> 00:20:22.670
but they've always lived alongside humans

00:20:22.670 --> 00:20:24.450
in the form of Bubuki.

00:20:25.130 --> 00:20:29.200
There's no difference between 
their lives and human lives.

00:20:29.880 --> 00:20:34.000
Then why did you stop the hearts 
of the Buranki on Earth?

00:20:35.300 --> 00:20:38.450
If humans had continued to 
wrongly manipulate the Buranki

00:20:38.450 --> 00:20:40.630
to serve their own purposes,

00:20:40.630 --> 00:20:43.050
something much worse would have happened.

00:20:43.430 --> 00:20:46.070
Like what you experienced...

00:20:47.910 --> 00:20:48.970
Mom...

00:20:49.450 --> 00:20:51.010
I'm just fine.

00:20:51.500 --> 00:20:52.770
So, Azuma...

00:20:53.450 --> 00:20:55.240
Please save Reoko.

00:20:55.640 --> 00:20:57.870
She's my precious friend.

00:21:17.030 --> 00:21:19.860
Even without hands and feet—

00:21:21.910 --> 00:21:23.050
Damn you!

00:21:26.390 --> 00:21:29.050
I won't let you knock Treasure 
Island down to Earth!

00:21:29.050 --> 00:21:31.930
And I'm going to save you, too!

00:21:36.560 --> 00:21:38.860
Let go of me, son of Migiwa!

00:21:39.960 --> 00:21:43.560
I'm not letting go of you, no matter what!

00:22:33.800 --> 00:22:37.580
<i>It's always geniuses who change the world,</i>

00:22:38.180 --> 00:22:43.000
<i>but ordinary people can't understand 
the way geniuses think.</i>

00:22:44.300 --> 00:22:48.400
<i>And Treasure Island, a place above the 
clouds that a genius tried to protect,</i>

00:22:48.400 --> 00:22:53.010
<i>sank into the sea, and this incident 
was settled once and for all.</i>

00:22:54.400 --> 00:22:55.680
Ta-da!

00:22:56.000 --> 00:22:59.390
And this is where our...

00:22:59.390 --> 00:23:05.200
No, "my," Kazuki Kaoruko's, story begins!

00:23:06.190 --> 00:23:08.840
I'm so excited! My heart is pounding!

00:23:08.840 --> 00:23:11.270
I can't wait, but I must!

00:23:11.270 --> 00:23:12.820
All good things to those who wait!

00:23:12.820 --> 00:23:14.030
So I have to wait!
